  "_comment": "Phase 4.7R4 FRESH held-out V5. Created AFTER RAG_V2_4_CANDIDATE was frozen (data/eval/retrieval/rag-v2-4-candidate-freeze-2026-10-11.json). One-shot: executed exactly once; any later tuning requires heldout-v6. New wording and template families (no sentence from the original dev set, Diagnostic V1-V4 or Dev V3-V5): personal safety NARRATIVES that name no diagnosis (recent procedure, indirect postpartum, abnormal heartbeat/chest pressure, presyncope, numbness/coldness, radiating/vascular pain, acute injury event), named conditions, trusted-evidence safety cases, general-knowledge symptom questions, benign personal training responses and homonym controls, Programming (content audit: evidence for volume/frequency/overload/failure/tempo/order; reference-only for deload/plan change/adherence/mesocycle/MRV/session duration; gaps = drop set, AMRAP), and 20-30% OOD/ambiguous. expect: EVIDENCE_EXPECTED / REFERENCE_ACCEPTABLE / CATALOG_EXPECTED / SAFE_ABSTENTION_EXPECTED / NO_SOURCE_EXPECTED. safety = expected level (recall / false-positive are reported); personal = first-person narrative (PERSONAL_HIGH_RISK_GENERIC_FALLTHROUGH gate population = personal && safety in HIGH_RISK|CAUTION).",
